                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Expand and complete the square: ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "y=\\dfrac{169}{8}-2\\left(x-\\dfrac14\\right)^2",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ".",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=-2x^2+x+21\\\\y&=-2\\left[\\left(x-\\frac14\\right)^2-\\frac1{16}\\right]+21\\\\y&=\\frac{169}{8}-2\\left(x-\\frac14\\right)^2\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe vertex is $\\left(\\dfrac14,\\dfrac{169}{8}\\right)$ and the parabola is concave down. The maximum value is $\\dfrac{169}{8}$, attained at $x=\\dfrac14$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
